    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Boss, Penguin Logistics is on the move."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Of course. I just gave her a few skin deep cuts..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "But I'm more worried about Capone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Y- yeah, we haven't been able to reach him. Tried real hard an hour ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Where's the last place you got him? The slums?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Er, yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "That's too bad."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Tell all the crews, we're going with the original plan to get Penguin Logistics..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "But I'm thinkin'... unless something goes wrong, we'll get two or three crews dropping off the grid."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "What do you mean... boss?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Couldn't be... Capone betrayed the Family?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "I get where he's comin' from. All too well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "We grew up together. And dad had us deal with a traitor, with our own two hands. That was my first time takin' a life. Our first time takin' a life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "The Siracusa fiasco changed us. The only difference is he turned weak, and I chose the clear path."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "He's gonna sell out the Family. Or I guess he wants to give the Family a new name."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "So what should we do about it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Penguin Logistics is turning out trickier than I thought. And we can't fight a war on too many fronts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "I'm thinkin' we deal with our traitor problem first."
    },
    {
