    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "Roger. Proceed as usual."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "W- wait! What's the plan here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "Huh? You screwed up something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "No, I just wanna be sure. I really don't know Lungmen at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "It's Sauin. When midnight rolls around, Lungmen kicks off a huge Carnival. The whole town turns out. That's when we rub out Penguin Logistics. Bada bing!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "Now about the boss..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "Don't ask too many questions. Just do what you're told. Chop-chop."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "...it's what it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "You ain't gonna kill me, are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Of course not. But you gotta take a nap for me like a good boy~"
