    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Mr. Capone, the boss's hit on Penguin Logistics looks like it failed."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
            "key": "$darkalley_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "What's that meathead worth? I don't even wanna hear his name."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "...Is that how we do it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "The Family needs a solid foundation. The name is the least important part."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Did you find the Rat King yet?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "Not yet. He really don't leave any tracks around..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "We gotta be patient. He's like a part of the city. He's Lungmen's shadow. It ain't like we got much time though."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "But we gotta be careful. If the Rat King picks up on what we're doin', we could find ourselves fighting three sides at once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "It's the same for everyone. If we're locked into a tough spot, the best thing to do is stir up some chaos."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You got news of Gambino?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You deaf?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "If you got somethin' to say to me, shouldn't you just say it to my face?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "How did you get in here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Not everybody's like you. Not everybody can just up and turn their back on an oath made before dad's grave."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Oath? That's just because we were walking the same path. But times have changed, Gambino."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You broke my heart, Capone. But I'll give you one last chance to explain yourself, as my brother."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Hmph. Seven years ago, when we buried the old boss, you sent me here, to Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "I came halfway across the world to set up a business that could support the Family, like a backstop."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "But then you had to go and screw up in Siracusa. And what do you do? You hop on over here and take over everything I broke my back to build."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Come on, you ain't gettin' pissed off over some little shit like this. Or you'd've been dead a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Say what you want. But today I learned the sharpest fangs in the Family's what's gonna turn around and kill it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "So you gonna pull out your fangs and snap a collar on yourself? Hah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "If you keep runnin' around Lungmen makin' noise like you do, sooner or later the powers that be are gonna get sick of it and wipe us out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Your deep and heartfelt concern for the Family is moving me to tears, dear Capone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "The feeling's mutual."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
